# Stop Engines When Finished

When a task ends (success, blocker, or handoff), if ZoneEngine / LoginEngine / ChatEngine / WebEngine were started or restarted during this session, stop them before the final reply:

```cmd
cmd /d /c stop-engines.cmd
```

Do not leave engines running after the task is done unless Mike explicitly asks to keep them up.
